 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "text is a string and dictionary is a list of distinct \"<key>:<id>\" entries. Starting at index 0, repeatedly take the longest key that equals the text starting at the current index, output its id and move past it. When no key starts at the current index, output that single character and move one position. Return the list of outputs.",
